<title>CHILE: Banco O'Higgins holders agree to merger.</title>
<headline>Banco O'Higgins holders agree to merger.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Chile's Banco O'Higgins approved plans for the bank to merge with Banco de Santiago at a meeting Thursday.</p>
<p>Banco de Santiago stockholders approved the deal at a meeting earlier Thursday.</p>
<p>Both banks are controlled by the Luksic industrial group.</p>
</text>
